OL,5,G2100 Gogglebox Ireland
OL,6,     FNew series, new telly, same
OL,7,     Fbrilliant banter. Join Ireland's
OL,8,     Ffavourite armchair critics as they
OL,9,     Freact to the week's biggest TV
OL,10,     Fmoments
OL,11,G2200 The Tonight Show
OL,12,     FComment and analysis on the big
OL,13,     Fstories of the day in Ireland and
OL,14,     Fabroad with a panel of guests
OL,15,     Fcovering the key issues.
OL,16,G2300 Who Wants to be a Millionaire?
OL,17,     FGeneral knowledge quiz. Ordinary
OL,18,     Fpeople are given the chance to win
OL,19,     Flife-changing amounts of money and
OL,20,     Fcelebrities attempt to earn cash
OL,21,     Ffor their chosen charities.
